{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "label": "Cluster sharding", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The answer to millions of entities each needing its own actor across N nodes: extract an entity id, hash it to a shard, let the coordinator decide which node hosts that shard, and let the node's region route. Each entity is one actor on one node at a time."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_region", "label": "Shard region actor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One per node. Routes to the right shard owner and decides when local entities \u2014 and shards left empty \u2014 passivate; the decision is the region's because only it sees traffic across every shard on this node, which is why maxEntities is a per-node cap."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shard", "label": "Shard actor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One per shard hosted here, a child of the region. Owns the entity actors, buffers for one on its way out, and goes away itself once it has stood empty for its window."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_coordinator", "label": "Sharding coordinator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One per cluster \u2014 a singleton on the leader. Decides which node owns each shard and handles rebalancing on membership changes and on a region shutting down."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_entity", "label": "Entity actor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shardkey", "label": "ShardKey", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A ShardKey's identity is its typeName alone; the extractor rides along so the declaring class is the single source of truth, and a lookup-only node can name the same type with no extractor. The explicit type argument is load-bearing \u2014 without it every ref degrades to ActorRef<unknown>."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shardingoptionstype", "label": "ShardingOptionsType", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_numshards_agreement", "label": "numShards is a cluster-wide agreement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two nodes with different counts put the same entity id in different shards, each owns the shard its own arithmetic produced, and both run a live instance at paths that never collide \u2014 for a persistent entity, two writers on one persistenceId. So the count travels in the region registration and the coordinator refuses a region that disagrees. The verdict arrives as a log line because registration is asynchronous and there is no call to throw from."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_refused_region", "label": "A refused region keeps buffering", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It is never allocated a shard and never hosts an entity, so the misconfiguration is a stall with an error next to it rather than a silent split."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_coordinatorstatestore", "label": "coordinatorStateStore snapshot stamping", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every shard id in a snapshot was produced under the writing coordinator's count, so a snapshot is stamped with that count and one taken under a different or unstated count is dropped whole. Without the check the load path would re-establish split routing through the snapshot rather than through the registration handshake, the one place counts are compared."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_passivation", "label": "Entity passivation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stops an idle entity to free memory; the region buffers messages that arrive while the entity is stopping and replays them to the fresh incarnation. In-memory state does not survive it \u2014 a PersistentActor replays and notices nothing, a plain actor starts over."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_passivation", "label": "Shards passivate too", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Passivating every entity used to leave a live actor holding an empty map, and because entity ids spread over the hash space a long-running node eventually kept all 64. The region keeps ownership so only the actor goes: the shard stays routable and the next message re-creates shard and entity together with no coordinator round trip."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_passivate_message", "label": "Passivate message", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Carries a stop-message forwarded back to the entity, so the entity decides exactly when and how it shuts down."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_identity", "label": "Entity identity (this.entityId / this.entity)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The commonest use is a per-entity persistenceId, giving a sharded PersistentActor one event stream per entity rather than one per type. It must be read from a getter: the actor context is attached after the constructor runs."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_name_escaping", "label": "Injective entity-name escaping", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Actor names have a restricted alphabet, so the shard escapes anything a name cannot carry. The escape is injective as a correctness property \u2014 a shared name means the second entity spawns under a taken name and the throw kills the shard along with every other entity in it. The path is a label; entityId is the value."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_rebalancing_overview", "label": "Rebalancing pass", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_state_across_failover", "label": "State across failover", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sharding gives placement and routing, not durability: without PersistentActor, DurableStateActor or DistributedData a moved entity starts with a clean slate."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_maxentities", "label": "maxEntities per-node LRU cap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_start_twice_throws", "label": "Starting the same type twice throws", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The second call used to return the first one's region, so a node asking for a hosting region got the proxy, whose placeholder entity factory throws the moment a shard lands locally."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_region", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_coordinator", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_entity", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_region", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shard", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_entity", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_coordinator", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_region", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shardkey", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shardingoptionstype", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shardingoptionstype", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_numshards_agreement", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_numshards_agreement", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_refused_region", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_numshards_agreement", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_coordinatorstatestore", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_start_twice_throws", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_passivation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_passivation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_passivation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_passivation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_passivate_message", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_passivation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_maxentities", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_region", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_passivation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_identity", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_identity", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_entity_name_escaping", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_rebalancing_overview", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_state_across_failover", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shard_introspection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_passivation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardinfo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_numshards_agreement", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardmap_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_rebalancing_overview", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_singleton_overview_cluster_singleton", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "sharding_actor_quartet", "label": "The four actors of cluster sharding", "nodes": ["docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_region", "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_shard", "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_coordinator", "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_entity"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/overview.mdx"}]}